75	        </p>
76	        <p className="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
77	          We credited {fmtMoney(priceCents)} back to your wallet. The usual causes are the confirmation email
78	          from your old registrar never being approved, the domain still being locked, a wrong auth code, or
79	          the 60-day ICANN window. Fix whichever applies and start again — {domainName} is still yours at your
80	          current registrar, nothing was lost.
