130	                {age === 0 ? "today" : `${age} day${age === 1 ? "" : "s"} ago`}
131	              </span>
132	            )}
133	          </dd>
134	        </div>
135	        <div className="flex justify-between">
136	          <dt className="text-slate-400">Typical duration</dt>
137	          <dd>5–7 days</dd>
138	        </div>
139	        <div className="flex justify-between">
140	          <dt className="text-slate-400">Paid</dt>
141	          <dd>{fmtMoney(priceCents)} · adds 1 year on completion</dd>
142	        </div>
143	      </dl>
144	
145	      <p className="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
146	        We re-check this with the registrar automatically — you don&apos;t need to keep this page open. Your
147	        site and email keep working at your current registrar throughout.
148	      </p>
149	
150	      <div className="mt-5 border-t border-white/[0.06] pt-4">
151	        {!confirming ? (
152	          <button type="button" className="btn-secondary" disabled={pending} onClick={() => setConfirming(true)}>
153	            Cancel this transfer
154	          </button>
155	        ) : (
156	          <div className="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-navy-950/60 p-4">
157	            <p className="text-sm text-slate-200">Cancel the transfer of {domainName}?</p>
158	            <p className="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-400">
159	              We ask the registrar to withdraw it. Your wallet is credited {fmtMoney(priceCents)} back{" "}
160	              <span className="text-slate-300">only once the registrar confirms the cancellation</span> — we
